---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Privacy Policy | Real BMI"
    description="Read the privacy policy of Real BMI. All health computations run locally in your browser — we never store, collect, or share your personal fitness data."
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
      title="Privacy Policy"
      eyebrow="Your data, your privacy"
      description="Learn how Real BMI protects your input data and keeps all calculations private and secure."
      returnUrl="/en/"
      returnLabel="Home"
    >
      <div class="space-y-8 prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed text-lg md:text-xl font-medium opacity-90">
        <p>At <strong>Real BMI</strong>, we consider user privacy and biological data security fundamental rights. Our comprehensive suite of health calculators—including Body Mass Index (BMI), Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR), Total Daily Energy Expenditure (TDEE), and body composition assessment tools—is built on an uncompromising privacy-first architecture where your physiological inputs remain exclusively under your control.</p>

        <h2>1. Zero Health Data Collection Architecture</h2>
        <p>We do not collect, intercept, store, or transmit your individual biometric parameters. When you enter personal health measurements—such as your stature, body weight, age, biological sex, waist circumference, or activity level—all mathematical calculations execute purely on the client-side within your device's web browser JavaScript engine. These numbers never leave your device, are never transmitted across the network to our web servers, and are never saved to any database or persistent cloud storage.</p>

        <h2>2. Local Browser Computation & Ephemeral Memory</h2>
        <p>Because computation occurs entirely locally, your session data is ephemeral. When you navigate away from the page, refresh your browser tab, or clear your session cache, all entered parameters and calculated results are instantly purged from volatile memory. Real BMI maintains no user accounts, requires no registration or login, and links no numerical scores to identifiable IP addresses.</p>

        <h2>3. Aggregate Technical Telemetry & Essential Server Logs</h2>
        <p>Like virtually all standard web properties, our hosting infrastructure automatically generates routine server access logs containing non-personally identifiable technical diagnostic data. This includes browser user-agent strings, operating system versions, referral URLs, requested file paths, and high-level geolocation (country and city level) to detect automated malicious traffic, mitigate distributed denial-of-service (DDoS) threats, and evaluate global server latency. These operational logs are strictly decoupled from calculator usage and contain zero health metrics.</p>

        <h2>4. Web Analytics, Advertising & Cookie Disclosures</h2>
        <p>Real BMI is supported by privacy-compliant digital advertising and aggregated analytics to keep our tools free and accessible to the public:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics 4 (Measurement ID: G-9D3TJCYP4R):</strong> Subject to your consent, we use Google Analytics to measure aggregate, anonymous site traffic and improve tool performance. IP anonymization is enforced, and telemetry is never linked to individual health calculations.</li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense (Publisher ID: ca-pub-6643535431949281):</strong> With your consent, Google and its certified partners use advertising cookies to display relevant, non-intrusive advertisements that fund the free development and hosting of our calculators.</li>
          <li><strong>Consent Mode & Control:</strong> We implement Google Consent Mode v2. Non-essential cookies and marketing scripts remain blocked by default until you grant explicit consent. You can modify your choices at any time via the "Cookie Preferences" link in our footer. For full technical details and storage tables, please review our dedicated <a href="/en/cookie-policy/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Visitors maintain full autonomy over their advertising preferences and may also opt out of personalized ad targeting through <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or industry opt-out portals such as <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">aboutads.info</a> and the <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">European Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance (EDAA)</a>.</p>

        <h2>5. Global Privacy Compliance: GDPR & CCPA/CPRA</h2>
        <p>In accordance with the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA), we affirm that Real BMI does not sell, rent, monetize, or disclose personal health information to third-party data brokers. Because our system does not collect or associate identifiers with health records, individual requests to delete or export data are inherently satisfied by our zero-retention infrastructure.</p>

        <h2>6. Cryptographic Security Standards</h2>
        <p>Our website enforces modern Transport Layer Security (TLS 1.3) with strict HTTP Strict Transport Security (HSTS) headers, modern cipher suites, and rigorous Content Security Policies (CSP) to ensure that your interaction with our calculators remains encrypted, tamper-proof, and shielded from eavesdropping or script injection.</p>

        <h2>7. Policy Amendments & Contact Inquiries</h2>
        <p>We may periodically update this Privacy Policy to reflect technical refinements or evolving international regulatory standards. Any revisions will be published immediately on this page with an updated timestamp. If you have inquiries regarding our data practices, browser execution model, or privacy choices, please reach out via our <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Contact Page</a> or write directly to our verified data desk at <strong>support@realbmicalculator.com</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
